OL,5,G1600 Composer of the Week: Purcell
OL,6,     F3/5. Donald Macleod explores the
OL,7,     Fchanging role of Purcell within
OL,8,     Fthe royal household, and the music
OL,9,     Fhe wrote for the various monarchs
OL,10,     Fwho ruled during his lifetime.
OL,11,G1700 In Tune
OL,12,     FKatie chats to Bob Chilcott and
OL,13,     Fintroduces live music from The
OL,14,     FVIDA Guitar Quartet.
OL,15,G1900 Classical Mixtape
OL,16,     FTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,17,     Fsoundscape of classical music.
