OL,5,G1930 Radio 3 in Concert
OL,6,     FThe BBC Philharmonic Orchestra
OL,7,     Fwith Chief Conductor John
OL,8,     FStorgards in Nielsen and
OL,9,     FRautavaara. They are joined by
OL,10,     FSimone Lamsma in Sibelius's Violin
OL,11,     FConcerto.
OL,12,G2145 The Essay: Jazz Among The British
OL,13,     FGeoffrey Smith continues his
OL,14,     Fseries on changing perceptions of
OL,15,     Fjazz in Britain, focusing on the
OL,16,     Fvisits of two celebrated American
OL,17,     Fartists, Duke Ellington and Bud
OL,18,     FFreeman.
